fier","text":"Interaction_DragView"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Reproduces the runner reference’s fixed layer hierarchy and framing: a full-screen"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"magenta canvas and a centered white card. The card maps "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.Drag"},{"type":"text","text":" Position to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its offset. Release projects momentum, applies the Drag patch’s logical bounds, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pulses Reset when both position axes are within the placed graph’s 100-point center"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tolerance."}],"title":"Interaction_DragView","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview"}}}